# --- sessions are plaintext-by-design: NEVER committed (same policy as the
#     excavator bundle's session/). Everything under sessions/ — HANDOFF.md,
#     runbooks, scripts, CREDENTIALS/audit files, loot copies — is a local
#     plaintext record. Git versions only the reproducible text: playbooks
#     and references/. Back session folders up externally if their loss
#     matters; do not 'fix' missing sessions by committing them.
sessions/

# --- defensive leftovers (harmless; superseded by the sessions/ blanket,
#     kept in case session material is ever copied outside sessions/) ---
**/loot/
**/*secrets*
**/uids.txt
**/.env
*.kdbx
*.key
*.pem
id_rsa*

# --- python / OS / harness junk ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.cline/